  <div class="section-header">
    <h3>Line 18. Totals.</h3>
  </div>
  <p>Add the amounts in columns (g) and (h) separately and enter the totals on line 18.</p>

  <div class="section-header">
    <h3>Line 19. Add columns (g) and (h) of line 18.</h3>
  </div>
  <p>Add the amounts in columns (g) and (h) of line 18. Enter the total on line 19.</p>

  <div class="section-header">
    <h3>Line 20. Total cash wages subject to FUTA tax.</h3>
  </div>
  <p>Enter the total cash wages subject to FUTA tax. See line 15 instructions, earlier, for details.</p>

  <div class="section-header">
    <h3>Line 21. Multiply line 20 by 6.0% (0.06).</h3>
  </div>
  <p>Multiply line 20 by 6.0% (0.06). Enter the result on line 21.</p>

  <div class="section-header">
    <h3>Line 22. Multiply line 20 by 5.4% (0.054).</h3>
  </div>
  <p>Multiply line 20 by 5.4% (0.054). Enter the result on line 22.</p>

  <div class="section-header">
    <h3>Line 23. Enter the smaller of line 19 or line 22.</h3>
  </div>
  <p>Enter the smaller of line 19 or line 22. However, if you paid state unemployment contributions late or you're in a credit reduction state, don't enter the smaller of line 19 or line 22. Instead, enter the amount of the state unemployment contributions you paid to any state contributions late if you paid any state contributions after the due date of your return.</p>

  <div class="section-header">
    <h3>Part III. Total Household Employment Taxes</h3>
  </div>
  <p><strong>Line 25.</strong> Enter the amount from line 8. Enter the amount from line 16 (or line 24) and line 25. Add the amounts on lines 16 (or line 24) and line 25. Add the amounts on lines 24 and 25 and enter the total on line 26.</p>
  <p><strong>Line 27.</strong> Are you required to file Form 1040? Follow the instructions in the following chart.</p>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">If you file Form...</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">THEN enter the amount from line 26 on Schedule H, Part I, line 9.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>1040 or 1040-SR</td>
      <td>Schedule 2 (Form 1040), line 9.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>1040-NR</td>
      <td>Form 1040-SR, Part I, line 9.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>1041</td>
      <td>Form 1041, Schedule G, Part I, line 7.</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</div>




